+   "source": [
+    "## Stage 1 — PCA coarse pre-alignment\n",
+    "\n",
+    "CPD is a local optimizer and heads are near-bilaterally-symmetric -- without\n",
+    "a decent initial pose, rigid CPD can converge to a self-consistent but wrong\n",
+    "rotation. PCA-align the principal axes first, resolving the sign/reflection\n",
+    "ambiguity by testing the 4 valid proper-rotation candidates."
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "execution_count": 7,
+   "id": "5b9b19df",
+   "metadata": {
+    "execution": {
+     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-07-10T07:44:00.905866Z",
+     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-07-10T07:44:00.905776Z",
+     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-07-10T07:44:01.199735Z",
