+    "**Full-pipeline stages deferred for later:** brain/internal-node TPS\n",
+    "propagation and the SDF cavity-constraint correction. Nothing else changes\n",
+    "when you add them back — Stage 5 gets extended to the full mesh and the\n",
+    "cavity constraint gets reinserted right after it.\n"
+   ]
