+    "— only the node coordinates of the skull-surface node set are updated.\n",
+    "\n",
+    "```\n",
+    "Template .k (skull+brain) ──┐\n",
+    "                              ├─ EXTRACT outer skull/skin surface only in VTU of both of it\n",
